            "ext_alt_text": "Yellow graphic detailing the traffic advisory for the 2025 Boston 10K:\n“Be advised that lanes of the Mass Pike will be closed from Friday, June 20th at 9:00 p.m. through Monday, June 23rd at 5:00 a.m. from Exits 123 to 125 — Weston to Newton. Drivers using the Mass Pike should expect a delay of up to 3 hours. Please find an alternate route.\nThe Orange Line from Forest Hills to North Station will be closed the weekend of the Boston 10K. The MBTA will provide shuttle buses From Forest Hills to Back Bay Station where riders will be encouraged to take the Green Line to North Station. From North Station, riders are encouraged to take the Green Line towards Boston Common. For more information visit mbta.com.\nPlan ahead, add extra time, and arrive early to Boston Common!”",
